//! tr kodlu 2 dil=en
// Error 10 — Index out of range.
// Message code: H2515
// What happens: Reading a position the list does not have raises an error at run time; the message tells the length and the fix.
// Why: The list has 3 items (indices 0, 1, 2); there is no index 5.
// Fixed version:
//     print(items.get(5) ?? 0) // if the item may be missing; or check the length: if 5 < items.length { ... }
// Run (from the project root): tr examples/en/errors/10_index_out_of_range.tr   (exit code 1)

A030 items = [10, 20, 30]
G100(items[5])
